{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--lexicalized-yay-verbs-shizunai","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--morphological-range"],"statement":{"en":"In Shizunai Ainu, some verb forms prefixed with yay- are completely lexicalized, such that their reflexive origin is evident only through etymological analysis (e.g. yaynu 'think' from nu 'listen', yaytura 'be alone' from tura 'join').","ja":"静内アイヌ語において、yay- を伴う動詞形の中には、yaynu「思う」（< nu「聞く」）や yaytura「一人でいる」（< tura「連れる」）のように、語源分析によってのみ再帰的起源が明らかになるほど完全に語彙化しているものがある。"},"type":"diachrony","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["yay-","yaynu","nu","yaytura","tura"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0174-02","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0175-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--yay-reflexive-coreference-shizunai","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--overview"],"statement":{"en":"In Shizunai Ainu, the prefix yay- derives reflexive expressions where the subject and object of the verb are coreferential.","ja":"静内アイヌ語において、接頭辞 yay- は動詞の主語と目的語が同一人物である再帰表現を形成する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["yay-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0174-01","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0175-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--yay-si-volitional-vs-nonvolitional","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--yay-si-distinction"],"statement":{"en":"The distinction between the reflexive prefixes yay- and si- is analyzed as volitional or intentional versus non-volitional or spontaneous reflexivity.","ja":"再帰接頭辞 yay- と si- の区別は、意志的・意図的な再帰（yay-）と無意志的・自発的な再帰（si-）の対立として分析される。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["yay-","si-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0184-03","stance":"reports"},{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0266-04","stance":"reports"},{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0033-04","stance":"reports"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--yay-si-direct-vs-indirect","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--yay-si-distinction"],"statement":{"en":"The distinction between yay- and si- is analyzed as direct reflexivity, where the subject acts directly, versus indirect reflexivity, where the action relies on or involves other people.","ja":"再帰接頭辞 yay- と si- の区別は、主語が直接手を下して行為を行う「直接的再帰」と、他者の関与や力に依存して間接的に行為を行う「間接的再帰」の対立として分析される。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"unstated","conditions":[]},"forms":["yay-","si-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaevakobayashi2022@handbook-epub/l0100-19","stance":"reports"},{"id":"stmt:bugaevakobayashi2022@handbook-epub/l0102-10","stance":"reports"},{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0185-01","stance":"reports"},{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0267-01","stance":"proposes"}],"relations":[{"kind":"contradicts","claim":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--yay-si-volitional-vs-nonvolitional","differs_in":"framework","note":"Satō's direct versus indirect reflexivity analysis directly competes with the traditional volitional versus non-volitional analysis of the yay-/si- distinction."}],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--the-prefix-yay-has-a-primary-reflexive-function","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--morphological-range"],"statement":{"en":"The prefix yay- has a primary reflexive function along with reflexive-possessive, autocausative, and occasionally anticausative functions.","ja":"接頭辞 yay- は主要な再帰機能に加えて、再帰所有、自己使役（autocausative）、そして時には反使役（anticausative）の機能を持つ。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yay-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2012@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0016-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--both-reflexive-prefixes-yay-and-si-can-attach","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--morphological-range"],"statement":{"en":"Both reflexive prefixes yay- and si- can attach as possessors to category 1 locative nouns and to incorporated body part nouns.","ja":"再帰接頭辞yay-とsi-の双方は、第1類位置名詞および抱合された身体部位名詞に所有者として付加することができる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yay-","si-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaevakobayashi2022@handbook-epub/l0100-21","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--attached-to-nouns-yai-expresses-mere-ordinary-1","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--morphological-range"],"statement":{"en":"Attached to nouns, yai- expresses 'mere/ordinary' (1), 'only one / one's own only' (2), and 'one's own' (3).","ja":"yai- は名詞に付いて、(1)「ただの」、(2)「ただひとつの」「自分だけの」、(3)「自分の」という意味を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["attached to nouns"]},"forms":["yai-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0122-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--the-combination-yai-ewen-contracts-to-yayewen","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--morphological-range"],"statement":{"en":"The combination yai-ewen contracts to yayewen.","ja":"yai-ewen の結合は yayewen になる。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yayewen","yai-","ewen"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0122-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--the-combination-yai-omap-contracts-to-yay-map","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--morphological-range"],"statement":{"en":"The combination yai-omap contracts to yayómap.","ja":"yai-omap の結合は yayómap になる。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yayomap","yayómap","yai-","omap"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0123-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--the-form-yai-shitoma-contracts-to-yashtoma","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--morphological-range"],"statement":{"en":"The form yai-shitoma contracts to yashtoma.","ja":"yai-shitoma は yashtoma と縮約する。"},"type":"alternation","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yashtoma","yai-shitoma"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0123-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--the-adjunct-reducing-prefixes-yay-u-and-si","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--morphological-range"],"statement":{"en":"The adjunct-reducing prefixes yay-, u-, and si- do not appear to have undergone decay in Shizunai Ainu.","ja":"補語減少接頭辞 yay-、u-、si- は、静内アイヌ語において同様の衰退を経験していないように見受けられる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yay-","u-","si-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0026-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--the-reflexive-prefixes-yay-and-si-belong-to","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--morphological-range"],"statement":{"en":"The reflexive prefixes yay- and si- belong to derivation rather than inflection, as they cannot be freely attached to any verb or locational noun.","ja":"再帰接頭辞 yay- と si- は屈折ではなく派生に属する要素であり、どんな動詞や位置名詞にも自由に付けられるわけではない。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yay-","si-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0268-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--the-combination-yai-ko-means-toward-oneself-against","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--ordering-stacking"],"statement":{"en":"The combination yai-ko means 'toward oneself', 'against oneself', or 'by oneself alone'.","ja":"yai-ko の結合は「自身に對して」「自身に向つて」「自分ひとりで」を意味する。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yaiko-","yai-","ko-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0123-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--there-are-examples-where-yay-appears-outside-si","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--ordering-stacking"],"statement":{"en":"There are examples where yay- appears outside si- (e.g. yay-si-turi-re 'stretch one's body out and lie down'), but none where si- appears outside yay-, suggesting si- is closer to a word-formation affix positioned closer to the root.","ja":"yay-si-turi-re「自分の体を伸ばして横たわる」のように yay- が si- の外側に来る例はあるが、逆に si- が yay- の外側に来る例は見られないため、si- の方が語根に近い形成接辞に近い性質を持つといえる。"},"type":"ordering","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yay-","si-","yay-si-turi-re"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0185-03","stance":"proposes"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--the-reflexive-prefix-yay-functions-as-the-equivalent","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--ordering-stacking"],"statement":{"en":"The reflexive prefix yay- functions as the equivalent of an object of the verb, whereas yay-ko- plays an adverbial role.","ja":"yay- は動詞の目的語相当であるが、yay-ko- は副詞的な役割を果たす。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yay-","yay-ko-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0208-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--when-reflexive-yay-applies-to-an-applicative-object","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--ordering-stacking"],"statement":{"en":"When reflexive yay- applies to an applicative object while the direct object is retained, the verb complex remains transitive.","ja":"直接目的語が保持されたまま再帰接頭辞 yay- が適用形目的語に適用される場合、動詞複合体は他動詞のままである。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["when direct object remains"]},"forms":["yay-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0033-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--reflexive-actions-where-the-subject-and-direct-indirect","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Reflexive actions where the subject and direct/indirect object are coreferential are expressed by reflexive verbs prefixed with yai-.","ja":"主語と目的語が同一である関係（我自身・汝自身・彼自身への作用）は、yai- を冠した再帰動詞によって表される。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yai-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0096-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--attached-to-verbs-yai-expresses-reflexive-meanings-to","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Attached to verbs, yai- expresses reflexive meanings 'to oneself' or 'oneself', although it often results in a middle-voice meaning.","ja":"動詞に付く yai- は「自身に」「自身を」の意味を表すが、中相になることも多い。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["attached to verbs"]},"forms":["yai-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0122-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--when-transitive-subject-and-object-are-coreferential-reflexivization","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--overview"],"statement":{"en":"When transitive subject and object are coreferential, reflexivization occurs using the reflexive prefixes yay- or si- ('self') rather than a combination of personal affixes.","ja":"主格と目的格が同一人称となる再帰形の場合は、人称接辞の組み合わせではなく、再帰接辞 yay-、si-「自分を・自分に」などを使って表される。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":["reflexive context (coreference of subject and object)"]},"forms":["yay-","si-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0167-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--ainu-has-two-reflexive-prefixes-meaning-oneself-acc","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Ainu has two reflexive prefixes meaning 'oneself (acc/dat)': yay- and si-.","ja":"アイヌ語には「自分を」を意味する再帰接頭辞として yay- と si- の二つの形式がある。"},"type":"existence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yay-","si-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0266-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--the-reflexive-prefix-yay-can-be-used-not","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--overview"],"statement":{"en":"The reflexive prefix yay- can be used not only for direct actions upon oneself, but also for actions quasi-directed at oneself such as commanding one's own companions.","ja":"再帰接頭辞 yay- は、主語による自分自身に対する直接的行為そのものだけでなく、自分の仲間に命令するようなそれに準ずる行為にも用いられる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/saru"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"possible","conditions":[]},"forms":["yay-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0307-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--personal-affixes-switch-from-transitive-to-intransitive-forms","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--overview"],"statement":{"en":"Personal affixes switch from transitive to intransitive forms when the reflexive prefix yay- derives an intransitive verb from a transitive one.","ja":"再帰接頭辞 yay- が他動詞から対応する自動詞を派生させるときにのみ、人称接辞は他動詞用から自動詞用へと変化する。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["when yay- changes a transitive verb into an intransitive verb"]},"forms":["yay-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0033-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--when-prefixed-to-a-transitive-verb-that-takes","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--overview"],"statement":{"en":"When prefixed to a transitive verb that takes only one object, the reflexive yay- or reciprocal 'u- fulfills the object role and typically turns the verb into an intransitive verb.","ja":"他動詞に接頭した yay- や 'u- は普通その目的語の役割を果たし，目的語を一つだけとる他動詞に接合すると普通自動詞になる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["monotransitive verbs"]},"forms":["yay-","'u-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:tamura1972@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0019-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--the-reflexive-prefix-yay-derives-the-transitive-verb","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--verb-classes"],"statement":{"en":"The reflexive prefix yay- derives the transitive verb yay-ko-ruska 'to be angry at oneself about something' from the ditransitive verb ko-ruska.","ja":"複他動詞 ko-ruska に再帰接頭辞 yay- が付くことで、他動詞 yay-ko-ruska「自分に対して～を怒る」が派生される。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["ko-ruska","yay-ko-ruska","yay-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2023b@pdftotext-pieces/l0003-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--ainu-has-two-reflexive-prefixes-canonical-or-direct","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--yay-si-distinction"],"statement":{"en":"Ainu has two reflexive prefixes: canonical or direct reflexive yay- and indirect reflexive si-.","ja":"アイヌ語には2つの再帰接頭辞、すなわち典型的な直接再帰を表すyay-と間接再帰を表すsi-が存在する。"},"type":"existence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yay-","si-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaevakobayashi2022@handbook-epub/l0100-18","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--in-contrast-to-volitional-yai-pusu-emerge-shi","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--yay-si-distinction"],"statement":{"en":"In contrast to volitional yai-pusu 'emerge', shi-pusu expresses involuntary emergence.","ja":"意志的な yai-pusu「出る」に対し、shi-pusu は無意志的である。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yai-pusu","shi-pusu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0123-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-yay--both-yay-and-si-are-translated-as-oneself","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-yay","topic:valency/reflexive-yay--yay-si-distinction"],"statement":{"en":"Both yay- and si- are translated as 'oneself' and express reflexive voice, but their usage differs considerably: si- has restrictions on the verbs it prefixes to, while yay- attaches relatively freely to any verb as well as to intransitive verbs and common nouns with an arity of 0.","ja":"yay- と si- はどちらも「自分」と訳され再帰態を表すが使われ方はかなり異なり、一般に si- の方が接頭する動詞に制限があるのに対し、yay- は比較的どんな動詞にもつき、自動詞や普通名詞にもアリティ0としてつくことができる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["yay-","si-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0184-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-10T15-13-12-354Z","status":"grouped"}
